# Repository Agent Guide

<!-- evolvable-application-preset:begin -->
This repository adopts the profile declared in `docs/standards/architecture-profile.yaml`.

Repository-local SSoT, standards, ADRs, contracts, source code, lockfiles, and executable evidence take precedence over generic Skill defaults.

## Read First

1. `docs/README.md`
2. `docs/ssot/README.md`
3. `docs/standards/README.md`
4. `docs/standards/architecture-profile.yaml`
5. `docs/standards/source-topology-and-naming.md`
6. `docs/standards/naming-vocabulary.yaml`
7. The nearest app/package/module README or local `AGENTS.md`

## Working Rules

- Reuse canonical project terms.
- Respect public/wiring and fact-writer boundaries.
- Prefer existing Harness surfaces and formal commands/queries.
- Report observations, supported conclusions, and unproven surfaces separately.

